          "HR Coordinators treats relocation expense reconciliation as a control problem rather than a speed problem. The work starts when an employee submits a relocation expense claim, not when someone remembers to check it. The HR coordinator gathers the relocation claim and the policy schedule, then confirms the signed offer term against the expense receipt. The benefits administrator keeps every decision that changes a payment or a benefits record, and the record should let a reviewer rebuild the case later.",
