          "Record the observation time separately from the entry time for relocation expense reconciliation. A value copied from the signed offer term on Friday may describe a record that changed on Monday. HR Coordinators keeps both times so the benefits administrator can judge whether the evidence was current. Freshness matters more than the number of attachments in the file."
