          "Authority limits for relocation expense reconciliation should include a scope, an amount or role boundary, and an end date. HR Coordinators reviews those limits when the benefits administrator changes or when a new exception appears. The HR coordinator can prepare the case but cannot extend a delegation that has expired. A standing instruction that never expires is not a control."
