          "Separate a data conflict from a policy question in relocation expense reconciliation. A conflict between the policy schedule and the signed offer term can be routed to the benefits administrator with both versions attached. A policy question needs the person who can interpret the rule, not the person who can edit the field. HR Coordinators uses different reason codes so the two cases do not get the same response."
