          "Test one closed relocation expense reconciliation case each week by rebuilding it from the evidence map. The reviewer should find the policy schedule, the decision to approve, adjust, or deny the reimbursement, and the confirmation without opening a private thread. If the rebuild fails, reopen the case or repair the template that allowed the gap. HR Coordinators records the result beside relocation claims matched to the policy schedule so the check is not a one-time exercise."
